use uo;

// World-save round-trip pass (POLCORE_TEST_RUN=3).
//
// The shard has just loaded the world the previous pass wrote. Do nothing to it and shut
// down again - the core saves the world on the way out, so the result is a load -> save
// round trip whose output can be byte-compared against its own input.
//
// Deliberately empty: every statement added here is a chance to mutate the world and turn
// the comparison red for a reason that has nothing to do with the save format.
program roundtrip()
  Shutdown( 0 );
endprogram
